    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover a Dark Mystery in a World of Magic and Danger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the enchanting yet perilous realm of <strong>Eswaydan</strong>, a valley steeped in mystery and magic, nestled within the cold, majestic peaks of the Thuyr Kingdom. But beware\u2014Eswaydan is cursed. Every five years, a lone hero is summoned from the legendary <strong>Hillside Hut</strong> to confront the dark forces that threaten to engulf the valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you be the one to break the cycle and save Eswaydan?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Engage in an epic RPG adventure</strong> filled with rich storytelling and deep, meaningful choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Explore a breathtaking world</strong>\u2014from icy mountains to ancient ruins\u2014and uncover the secrets of Eswaydan\u2019s curse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Embark on epic quests\u00a0</strong>or explore the world on your terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fate of Eswaydan is in your hands. Will you rise to the challenge, or will the valley succumb to eternal darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your adventure begins now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860490/extras/417607ec9ba15ed121e13ef331d1d92f.poster.avif?t=1738362249\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860490/extras/417607ec9ba15ed121e13ef331d1d92f.webm?t=1738362249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860490/extras/417607ec9ba15ed121e13ef331d1d92f.mp4?t=1738362249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>KEY FEATURES</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>* A deep and dark story to uncover.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>* Fun and difficult combat that emphasizes on blocking and evading attacks or attack your enemies from afar with a wide varieties of bow &amp; arrow combos. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>* A beautifull and vast snowy world that is completely open world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>* RPG elements with questing, leveing and character customization!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlisting is the best and easiest way to help our indie game succeed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">@Sentinelstudios on Instagram &amp; Reddit!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord; </p>",
